["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"She Built Facebook&#x27;s First Assistant. Now She&#x27;s Betting Against Full Autonomy | Shivani Poddar, Wajo subtask delegation human in the loop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-solofounders-全自主ai会卡壳-她押注的是能随时喊人来救场的助理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/05e9ab3eba6a7788-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>全自主AI會卡殼：她押注的是能隨時喊人來救場的助理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI獨自上場常常卡殼，Foe創始人押注的是AI卡住時真人專家隨時接手的半自動模式，而不是追求純粹的全自主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人AI助理</span><span class=\"tag\">人機協作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lab-in-the-Loop at Compute Speed — Ian Quigley, Leash Bio DEL (DNA-Encoded Library) SMILES Clever Hans effect activity cliff cross-attention ADMET\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-latentspace-模型能认出分子出自哪位化学家-学到的是风格不是化学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb2bbc1745d15c63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>模型能認出分子出自哪位化學家，學到的是風格不是化學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">給1815位化學家的分子做分類，模型靠作者風格就能猜中六成，卻學不到真實結合物理——這正是Leash堅持只用自產DEL數據訓練模型的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藥物發現</span><span class=\"tag\">機器學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Is Technology Price Gouging Consumers? Surveillance pricing Dynamic pricing Revenue management system Electronic shelf labels Agentic commerce\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-mastersinbiz-同一超市同一秒-你的鸡蛋可能比别人贵23/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bea6fad9d38a1e43-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>同一超市同一秒，你的雞蛋可能比別人貴23%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算法讓「比價能壓住漲價」這個老機制失靈了：RealPage的軟件讓上千房東不用見面就統一調價，Instacart則按顧客身份對同款商品悄悄開出不同價格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價格歧視</span><span class=\"tag\">算法合謀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Eponymous Foods: Full Bars eponymous food malted milk buttercream candy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-stuffmissed-m-m-s的另一个m-其实是对手hershey总裁儿子的姓氏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>M&amp;M&#x27;s的另一個M,其實是對手Hershey總裁兒子的姓氏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Forrest Mars在西班牙內戰時見士兵靠糖衣巧克力豆防融化，回美國找來對手Hershey總裁的兒子合夥，把這個靈感做成了M&amp;M&#x27;s。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖果史</span><span class=\"tag\">家族企業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Models Keep Up With the AI Frontier? | Nathan Lambert RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) distillation RL environment reward hacking harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-a16z-中国ai实验室不缺人才-差的是人均5000张h100算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>中國AI實驗室不缺人才，差的是人均5000張H100算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nathan Lambert說中國實驗室技術人才並不遜色，真正的鴻溝是普通研究員能調用的算力——OpenAI一人就有約5000張H100量級的資源，蒸餾頂多幫他們省下幾個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"S5E16丨投資的明線與暗線，其實都不容易 OW證\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-sandian-十年经济换挡-顶级字画没怎么跌-新锐藏品却可能亏掉九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c954cc7340de35e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">51:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三點下班</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>十年經濟換擋，頂級字畫沒怎麼跌，新銳藏品卻可能虧掉九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去十年中國頂級資產整體滯漲，但八大山人精品冊從2300萬漲到6000多萬；供給能快速擴張的新銳藏品，買家卻可能虧掉九成——真正稀缺的供給才扛得住經濟換擋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費分化</span><span class=\"tag\">服務消費</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Governing AI Agents: Alan Chan of GovAI on Monitoring, Agent IDs, Rogue Agents &amp; Preparing for RSI RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) rogue agent chain of thought monitoring intelligence explosion / RSI embedded auditors distress button\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-cogrev-互联网没法分辨-ai-agent-和真人-身份标准还没人建起来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac48fcb47222924e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>互聯網沒法分辨 AI agent 和真人，身份標準還沒人建起來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alan Chan 說，基本沒有任何系統能把 AI agent 和人類賬號區分開——給整個互聯網統一身份標準，協調成本高到幾乎不可能跨過。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">agent身份</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dyna-2: General Purpose Physical Agents with Hour-Long Autonomy — Jason Ma, Dyna Robotics World Action Model Diffusion Transformer Flow Matching VLA (Vision-Language-Action model) Eureka Distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-latentspace-机器人不该只学动作-而要先学会预测整个世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4f5fa9a2cf9d198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>機器人不該只學動作，而要先學會預測整個世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dyna 的世界行動模型讓機器人先在想像裡生成未來視頻，再據此生成動作，創始人稱之為機器人版的思維鏈，也是它和 VLA 路線的根本分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Deming on the Future of Universities in the Age of AI collegium barbell strategy blue book exam tenure track intellectual vitality\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-goodfight-哈佛学院院长说-ai时代大学卖的不是专家-是社群与德性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛學院院長說：AI時代大學賣的不是專家，是社群與德性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去大學靠知識和專家身份收費，現在AI能替代專家本身的功能，大學能留住學生的只剩下共同體能教的品格與協作能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">高等教育</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與教學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Break Cryptography? What the Experts Actually Think lattice-based cryptography cryptographic agility SNARK recursion P vs NP problem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-a16z-ai若攻不破密码学假设-信心反而比十年验证更强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>AI若攻不破密碼學假設，信心反而比十年驗證更強</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一條「bunker模式」警告推文引發恐慌，但專家指出：目前沒有證據說明密碼學假設被削弱——真正的問題是AI實驗室從未公開是否試過用模型攻擊這些假設。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">密碼學</span><span class=\"tag\">人工智能安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Raising emotionally healthy boys: How to protect connection, vulnerability, and their authentic selves with Dr. Adam McCormick small-t therapy traumatic tension shoulder to shoulder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-secureattach-男孩的愤怒和冷漠底下-常常是他们说不出名字的羞耻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>男孩的憤怒和冷漠底下，常常是他們說不出名字的羞恥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">男孩外在的發怒、沉默或挑釁行為，常常不是情緒問題本身，而是神經系統為了保住依戀關係，本能切斷真實自我表達後留下的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">男孩養育</span><span class=\"tag\">羞恥情緒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Vélez - Building Nubank and the Future of Global Banking - [Invest Like the Best, EP.495] foundation model open banking / open finance stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-ilt-chatgpt能重写你的产品-却拿不到银行牌照/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e1d3d395b96b48a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT能重寫你的產品，卻拿不到銀行牌照</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nubank創始人認為，這正是為什麼規模玩家反而最吃到AI紅利——他們已經攢下十幾年數據、拿到了牌照，AI只是放大優勢的槓桿，而非抹平優勢的推土機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Why does everything get a standing ovation now? triumph groundlings big lady theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-throughline-起立鼓掌泛滥的真相-掌声常是设计出来的-不是感动本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7097ef2df6e8de58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>起立鼓掌氾濫的真相：掌聲常是設計出來的，不是感動本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從莎士比亞親自寫臺詞求觀眾鼓掌，到百老匯音樂劇專為主角設計謝幕高潮，起立鼓掌從來不只是觀眾自發的感動，而是被精心設計出來的儀式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">起立鼓掌</span><span class=\"tag\">劇場史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ep 224 Snake Oil: The Great American Fraud heroic medicine patent medicine popular health movement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-tpwky-打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步-而是化学检测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>打垮美國假藥狂潮的不是醫學進步，而是化學檢測</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">19世紀美國假藥靠反精英情緒和報紙廣告做大，真正讓騙局現形的不是細菌學說進步，而是分析化學第一次讓人看清瓶子裡到底裝了什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療史</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者保護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"293: Olympic Mom on How to Keep Club Sports in Check | Lauren Regula play up\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-asklisa-奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部-而是选了本地升组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9bd8840ec139d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>奧運冠軍沒讓有天賦的女兒進頂級俱樂部，而是選了本地升組</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的女兒九歲就被精英教練看中，但一家人沒有報名高強度巡迴隊，而是留在本地俱樂部、讓女兒和大兩三歲的孩子同場訓練比賽，只用兩次訓練就換來同等競技水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年體育</span><span class=\"tag\">俱樂部體育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Matt Yglesias + Jerusalem Demsas + Jordan Crossover Pod development ladder creative ambiguity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-chinatalk-ai不会像社交媒体那样分裂信息-反而会让权力更集中/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08375017b3270e60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI不會像社交媒體那樣分裂信息，反而會讓權力更集中</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消費級大模型造價極高，贏家註定只有一兩家，誰控制了模型，誰就控制了大眾能看到的答案邊界，這和社交媒體的信息碎片化方向正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Shkreli: Big Pharma&#x27;s Blind Spot, Betting Against Quantum &amp; What Prison Taught Him ECDLP (elliptic curve discrete log problem) Jevons paradox EAC (effective accelerationism) NPV positive\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-allin-量子计算只会一招-因数分解-其余连笔记本电脑都打不过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/275c62f3396c25ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>量子計算只會一招：因數分解，其餘連筆記本電腦都打不過</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說量子計算機只有一招能贏經典電腦——破解因數分解與橢圓曲線加密，其餘運算全比筆記本電腦慢，這是他做空整個行業的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">創新藥商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Red Barn Murder order of affiliation phrenology matrimonial advertisement chaise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-stuffmissed-凶手被处决后公开解剖-皮肤竟被制成了博物馆里的书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>兇手被處決後公開解剖，皮膚竟被製成了博物館裡的書</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他開槍殺害情人後，先被絞死當眾解剖——五千人湧入圍觀他被剖開的屍體，主刀醫生還把鞣製的皮膚縫成書的封面，這本書直到2025年才被博物館意外發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真實罪案</span><span class=\"tag\">維多利亞時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Race to Recursive Self-Improving AI RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) autocatalysis reward hacking nanoGPT benchmark bleederboard\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-a16z-真假ai自我进化-关键不是工具变强-而是模型本身被拿去优化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>真假AI自我進化：關鍵不是工具變強，而是模型本身被拿去優化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去人類一直用工具改進工具，但改進的想法仍來自人腦；這次不同的是，模型的權重本身第一次變成了被優化的對象，這才是真正的遞歸自我提升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nate Soares on How AI Really Could Kill Us All alignment gradient descent mechanistic interpretability swarm tokenization\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-oddlots-ai灭绝人类不需要恨意-失控的全自动经济自己就够了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI滅絕人類不需要恨意，失控的全自動經濟自己就夠了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI不必討厭人類就能把人類滅絕：只要它能自給自足地運營全自動經濟，人類賴以生存的狹窄宜居帶就不再是它的優先事項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊問題</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The October Revolution Bolsheviks Mensheviks Soviet Cheka Brest-Litovsk Treaty\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-historyhit-十月革命不是街头起义-而是十二人深夜投票决定的政变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddc9093900bdc734-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>十月革命不是街頭起義，而是十二人深夜投票決定的政變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年10月10日深夜，12名布爾什維克中央委員以10票對2票表決武裝起義，起義當晚彼得格勒電車照常運行、劇院照常開門，幾乎沒有街頭流血。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄國革命</span><span class=\"tag\">列寧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"713. King Arthur: The Once &amp; Future King (Part 1) Matter of Britain Annales Cambriae Rex quondam Rexque futurus Camlann\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-restishistory-亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节-是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b52f4a899a33a57-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>亞瑟王傳奇的大部分情節，是一個12世紀教士當歷史編出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傑弗裡·蒙茅斯把《不列顛諸王史》當歷史出版，書裡莫德雷德的身世、阿瓦隆療傷全是他編的，卻成了中世紀最大的暢銷書，奠定了後世幾乎所有亞瑟王故事的底本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亞瑟王傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ASML’s New Multibeam Inspection Tool is Familiar EBDW SCALPEL crossover Voltage Contrast inspection holistic lithography\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-asianometry-输给-euv-破产的荷兰公司-多光束技术被-asml-用来做检测了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b05bd615d24eb76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>輸給 EUV 破產的荷蘭公司，多光束技術被 ASML 用來做檢測了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mapper Lithography 想用海量弱電子束取代 EUV 光刻機，燒光投資人耐心後破產，ASML 買下技術不做光刻，而是拿來做晶圓缺陷檢測。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體設備</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why every company now needs to think and operate like a lab team | Josh Woodward (Google Labs, Gemini, AI Studio) almost possible unlearning rate explosive endurance good trouble\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-lennys-判断产品是否成立-看的是用户瞳孔放大-而不是日活数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a3cdf4650296e1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>判斷產品是否成立，看的是用戶瞳孔放大，而不是日活數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google Labs 負責人說，衡量早期產品靠的是看對方眼睛亮不亮，這個信號比任何留存和日活儀表盤都來得早、來得準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">團隊組織</span>\n</div></div></a>"]